{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong>\u00a0This purchase includes Chapter One only. Additional chapters will be released later as downloadable content (DLC).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/4d5c7de785f110fe8e95fa2d061a07b4.poster.avif?t=1755802579\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/4d5c7de785f110fe8e95fa2d061a07b4.webm?t=1755802579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/4d5c7de785f110fe8e95fa2d061a07b4.mp4?t=1755802579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pact is a first-person psychological horror game in which you unravel your family's dark legacy across generations. Face unsettling trials, uncover truths meant to stay forgotten, and witness the horrors that follow your bloodline through the centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3945690/extras/4aa9ffcc981c9baa1e567e57764510dc.avif?t=1755802579\" width=1600 height=648 /></span>Play as Will Davidson in the first chapter of The Pact, forced to navigate twisted corridors, uncover fragments of a hidden truth, and face choices that challenge your very humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven experience</strong>\u00a0- uncover a tale of secrets, betrayal, and dark family history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric exploration</strong>\u00a0- move through unsettling spaces where every corner holds a sense of unease.</p></l